cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "k8s-lab"
version: "2.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
abstract: >-
  Kubernetes clusters on one Debian or Ubuntu host, managed by Cluster API:
  unprivileged LXC system containers (LXD) as nodes, a self-hosted management
  cluster, workload clusters through Terraform. Ansible roles, Helm charts,
  Terraform modules, and a Molecule + Vagrant + libvirt test harness.
authors:
  - name: "kogeler"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kogeler/k8s-lab"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - kubernetes
  - cluster-api
  - capn
  - lxd
  - incus
  - lxc
  - ansible
  - terraform
  - helm
  - homelab
